    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύσσομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύξομαι</span> Epic.in <i><span class="en">
			<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
			7.5
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow the
				nose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύσσονται δὲ οὐδέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					3.70
				</span></i>
			:—
				Act.
			 (dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>) is only found in compds. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-,
				προ-μύττω</span>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυκτήρ,
			μύξα</span> (A); Skt. <i>muncáti</i> 'let go', Lat.
				<i>e-mungo.</i>)</div>
